# Coordinated Maneuver, first mode: "deals damage equal to the number of creatures you control to target creature or planeswalker"
# (CR 120.3, 608.2h). Bot1 controls two Ornithopters, so it deals exactly 2: it kills Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) and, being counted for
# Bot1's creatures only, would not if Bot1 had one fewer. It cannot be aimed at Bot2's Mox Pearl, which is no creature.

